  "headline": "FDA's records trace our supply to a plant classified OAI 3551 days before the shortage posting",
  "headline_cites": ["E4", "D3"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 590126 of Bryant Ranch PrePack ended 2009-06-11 and was classified OAI with six observations including lack of a written stability program and complaint investigation deficiencies.",
      "cites": ["E4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "That OAI classification occurred 3551 days before FDA posted the enalapril maleate shortage on 2019-03-29.",
      "cites": ["E4", "D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Subsequent inspections of the same plant through 2026-07-16 have all been classified VAI.",
      "cites": ["E5", "E6", "E7", "E8", "E9", "E10", "E11", "E12"]
    },
    {
      "text": "As of 2026-10-21 the shortage has been on FDA's list for 91 months.",
      "cites": ["D8"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 507 units at 11.4 units per day for 44 days on hand, while Corvale General holds 263 units at 14 units per day for 19 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule-based best option is to buy from A-S Medication Solutions, which is not on FDA's shortage list today and whose plant was last inspected VAI on 2026-08-12.",
      "cites": ["D5"]
    }
  ]
}
